232
00:29:07,328 --> 00:29:18,724
And when the agents need to act, they query this knowledge with Google-powered search that enforces the security permissions, which is important, so that they only retrieve what they're authorized to see.

233
00:29:19,054 --> 00:29:34,084
It even saves tokens by giving agents just the right context to get the job done, avoiding the costly callbacks to the data systems, and also unnecessary reasoning loops, and gives about 50% greater accuracy with it.

