00:48:33,326 --> 00:48:45,408
That allows you to automate the process of generating more templates, generating more facets, generating more value search queries, and then running evals to tell you if they work correctly, if they address the gaps or not.

433
00:48:45,806 --> 00:48:50,628
And then if they do address the gaps, you can push that updated context into knowledge catalog.

434
00:48:51,022 --> 00:48:55,780
And immediately the next time the agent is asked that question, it now has enough information to answer it accurately.

