683
01:13:36,590 --> 01:13:38,148
So, how do these agents actually work?

684
01:13:38,478 --> 01:13:40,772
So they work by running reasoning loops.

685
01:13:41,198 --> 01:13:46,468
And these reasoning loops allow them to think, and as they think, they query the data.

